									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Chronime Puzzle: Horses</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Chronime Puzzle: Horses</strong> is a tile-rotation puzzle that combines engaging picture puzzles with beautiful equine illustrations and a soothing atmosphere. Discover a captivating world of majestic horses, steampunk aesthetics, and anime-inspired artwork.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explore a stunning collection of horse-themed artwork inspired by the imaginative world of steampunk, where vintage elegance meets fantasy and mechanical creativity.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Rotate Pieces. Complete Pictures. Discover Horses.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Rotate and place equal-sized picture tiles to rebuild each illustration. These tile-rotation puzzles combine visual logic with spatial thinking. Let the steampunk anime artwork guide your next move.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Simple controls keep your attention on tile orientation and the position of every piece. The gradually rising difficulty rewards observation, logic and a clear sense of space. Your clues are in the image.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete <strong>50 unique levels</strong>, unlock beautiful horse illustrations, and discover more of the fascinating Chronime world with every solved puzzle.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5366840/extras/b1d583d0fff450b1e70fdff4dc4c20d1.poster.avif?t=1793956736" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5366840/extras/b1d583d0fff450b1e70fdff4dc4c20d1.webm?t=1793956736" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5366840/extras/b1d583d0fff450b1e70fdff4dc4c20d1.mp4?t=1793956736" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Horses Meet Steampunk Anime</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Immerse yourself in a colorful collection of illustrations that blend majestic horses with distinctive steampunk and anime aesthetics.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >From vintage-inspired designs to imaginative mechanical details and fantasy-inspired settings, every picture offers a new visual experience. Discover the beauty of stylized horse artwork as you rotate, arrange, and restore each illustration, piece by piece.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Tile Puzzles With Music</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Settle into a relaxing single-player puzzle game and enjoy a quiet change of pace. Soothing background music accompanies each image as you work through its visual clues. Give each image the time and attention you want.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whether you love horses, relaxing puzzle games, anime aesthetics, or satisfying picture puzzles, Chronime Puzzle: Horses offers a peaceful single-player experience filled with beautiful equine art and gentle challenges.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Key Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>50 Unique Puzzle Levels</strong> — Rotate and arrange picture pieces to complete increasingly challenging visual puzzles.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Beautiful Horse Illustrations</strong> — Unlock a collection of captivating horse-themed artwork.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steampunk Anime Aesthetics</strong> — Explore a distinctive combination of vintage elegance, imaginative mechanical details, and colorful anime-inspired art.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Relaxing Puzzle Gameplay</strong> — Enjoy casual, stress-free puzzles without time pressure.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Intuitive Mouse Controls</strong> — Rotate and position image pieces with simple, comfortable controls.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Soothing Music and Atmosphere</strong> — Relax with calming background music as you solve each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> — Unlock achievements as you progress through the game.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Rotate the pieces. Restore the artwork. Discover the world of Chronime.</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					The background images and horses pictures are pre-rendered AI art				</i>
			</p>
